<div class="dashboard summary-function">
  <div class="dashboard-header">
    <span class="lua-section"><span class="tag lua-tag">Lua</span><DocsCode code={`ll.RequestExperiencePermissions(AgentID: uuid, unused: string)`} lang="slua" /></span>
    <span class="lsl-section"><span class="tag lsl-tag">LSL</span><DocsCode code={`llRequestExperiencePermissions(key AgentID, string unused);`} lang="lsl" /></span>
  </div>

  <div class="dashboard-body">
    <div class="dash-col">
      <p>  <p>Asks the agent for permission to participate in the script's <a href="https://wiki.secondlife.com/wiki/Category:LSL_Experience" target="_blank">Experience</a>.</p>
</p>
      <table class="param-table" id="parameters">
        <tr>
          <td><span class="lua-section"><span class="tag lua-tag">Lua</span>uuid</span></td>
          <td><span class="lsl-section"><span class="tag lsl-tag">LSL</span>key</span></td>
          <td>AgentID / <a href="https://wiki.secondlife.com/wiki/Category:LSL_Parameters/agent" target="_blank">agent</a></td>
          <td><a href="https://wiki.secondlife.com/wiki/Key" target="_blank">Key</a> of the agent to request permissions from</td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td><span class="lua-section"><span class="tag lua-tag">Lua</span>string</span></td>
