          <td>unused / <a href="https://wiki.secondlife.com/wiki/Category:LSL_Parameters/name" target="_blank">name</a></td>
          <td>Deprecated, no longer used</td>
        </tr>
      </table>
    </div>

    <div class="dash-col">
      <div class="dash-section-title">Categories</div>
